WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.690
Last day with life and breath.

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:06.820
Today you explain why one idea needed two roots.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:11.400
In Spelling, the words change in different ways when an ending is added.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.800
Sometimes a silent e drops.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.980
Sometimes the base changes more.

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:18.140
Sometimes nothing changes.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.510
Look closely at the base each time.
